<title>USA: FSA announces secondary market capacity.</title>
<headline>FSA announces secondary market capacity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance</p>
<p>has secondary insurance capacity for:</p>
<p>--California State Public Works Board, Lease Revenue</p>
<p>(Department os Corrections only)</p>
<p>--New York City G.O.</p>
<p>--New York City Water Revenue</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico Highway Authority</p>
<p>Insurance is availble on maturities 2004 and longer. There is no par limit per firm.</p>
<p>For further details, please contact Tom Byrne, Greg Haggerty or Alan Steinfeld at 212 826-0601.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
